  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Symptoms",
     "texto": [
      "**生病** means to get sick or be ill; **感冒**, to catch a cold; **发烧**, to have a fever; **咳嗽**, to cough. **头疼** and **肚子疼** express a headache and a stomachache.",
      "**觉得** means «to feel» or «to seem», depending on the context. **身体** is body; **舒服**, comfortable or well."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
